Data
----
- Street network: Overture Maps Foundation transportation theme, release
  2026-08-19.0, derived from OpenStreetMap. (c) OpenStreetMap contributors,
  available under the Open Database Licence (ODbL) 1.0,
  https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/. Overture schema: CDLA
  Permissive 2.0.
  The packed street graph published in site/data/graph-*.bin.gz is a derived
  database of this data and is itself made available under the ODbL 1.0.
  Attribution is shown in the app's map attribution.
- Place search: Overture Maps base theme (ODbL 1.0, derived from
  OpenStreetMap), Overture places (CDLA Permissive 2.0) and Overture addresses
  (OpenAddresses / City and County of San Francisco).
- Elevation: USGS 3D Elevation Program (3DEP) 1 m lidar DEM, project
  CA_SanFrancisco_B23, and the 1/3 arc-second DEM tile n38w123. Public domain
  (U.S. Geological Survey).
- Neighbourhood boundaries: San Francisco planning neighbourhoods, via the
  Code for America click_that_hood mirror (open data).

Map display
-----------
The app draws no third-party map tiles: its base map is a hillshade rendered
from the USGS lidar above and the street lines from the graph itself.
Fonts (IBM Plex Sans and IBM Plex Mono, SIL Open Font Licence 1.1) are loaded
from Google Fonts.
